        ]
      },
      "worked": "Let $\\theta=\\angle ACB$. By the cosine rule,\n$$\\begin{align*}\n\\cos\\theta&=\\frac{15^2+10^2-17^2}{2(15)(10)}\\\\\n\\cos\\theta&=\\frac3{25}\\\\\n\\theta&=\\cos^{-1}\\!\\left(\\frac3{25}\\right).\n\\end{align*}$$\nUse the unrounded angle in the area rule:\n$$\\begin{align*}\nA&=\\frac12(15)(10)\\sin\\!\\left(\\cos^{-1}\\!\\left(\\frac3{25}\\right)\\right)\\\\\nA&\\approx74.5\\text{ cm}^2.\n\\end{align*}$$",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
